Comment: 0,0:11:11.98,0:11:14.65,Default,002,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:11:18.71,0:11:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,什...
Comment: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,退後!
Comment: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂!
Comment: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然不知道...
Comment: 0,0:11:37.91,0:11:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你是何方神聖
Comment: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這種東西
Comment: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,你認為對我有用嗎?
Comment: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人!
Comment: 0,0:11:51.74,0:11:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子
Comment: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳不要出手
Comment: 0,0:11:54.49,0:11:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,御坂
Comment: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我竟然無法操縱它
Comment: 0,0:11:57.67,0:11:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,並沒有防護罩
Comment: 0,0:11:59.06,0:11:59.58,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,還是說
Comment: 0,0:11:59.96,0:12:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,原本就根本沒有電力系統?
