Comment: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼 接下來
Comment: 0,0:12:06.67,0:12:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那為什麼可以動啊?
Comment: 0,0:12:18.43,0:12:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然不是很明白
Comment: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,外觀看起來是人可以乘坐在裡面的感覺
Comment: 0,0:12:24.68,0:12:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,麻煩死了!!
Comment: 0,0:12:34.73,0:12:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,糟糕
Comment: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天!
Comment: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,佐天!
Comment: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春
Comment: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,聯絡警備員
Comment: 0,0:12:40.42,0:12:41.76,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(1020,980)}Anti-skill
Comment: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,知道了
Comment: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為...為什麼
Comment: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了?
Comment: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,手機沒有訊號!
Comment: 0,0:12:51.21,0:12:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這怎麼回事
Comment: 0,0:12:54.15,0:12:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理!
Comment: 0,0:12:55.78,0:12:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂 很危險啊
Comment: 0,0:12:57.80,0:12:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳在幹什麼?
Comment: 0,0:12:58.78,0:12:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快點
Comment: 0,0:12:59.11,0:12:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快一點離開
Comment: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這...
Comment: 0,0:13:10.90,0:13:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這怎麼回事
Comment: 0,0:13:15.56,0:13:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,動作...
Comment: 0,0:13:16.76,0:13:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓開!
Comment: 0,0:13:29.46,0:13:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,惹到我的下場就是這樣
Comment: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,婚后!
Comment: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼妳會在這裡?
Comment: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,朋友在的地方就有我婚后在啊
Comment: 0,0:13:39.37,0:13:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說回來 這是發生什麼事
Comment: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對了
Comment: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,究竟是何方神聖做出這種事...
Comment: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是...什麼?
Comment: 0,0:13:50.07,0:13:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,空的?
Comment: 0,0:13:51.87,0:13:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼回事...
Comment: 0,0:13:53.40,0:13:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:13:55.09,0:13:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,怎麼了?
Comment: 0,0:13:56.11,0:13:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,振作一點
Comment: 0,0:14:00.14,0:14:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理!
Comment: 0,0:14:02.20,0:14:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這也是預料之中
Comment: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,果然
Comment: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們的計算是正確的
Comment: 0,0:14:09.47,0:14:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳沒事吧?
Comment: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理!
Comment: 0,0:14:11.91,0:14:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,哪裡受傷了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:14:13.30,0:14:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,叫...叫救護車
Comment: 0,0:14:14.66,0:14:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是手機...
Comment: 0,0:14:17.76,0:14:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,有訊號了
Comment: 0,0:14:20.27,0:14:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼快點聯絡救護車
Comment: 0,0:14:22.98,0:14:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好的
Comment: 0,0:14:27.31,0:14:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又是妳們啊
Comment: 0,0:14:29.92,0:14:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真想讓你見識一下啊
Comment: 0,0:14:32.06,0:14:33.91,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,我大展身手的樣子
Comment: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:35.18,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,將逼近的機器人
Comment: 0,0:14:35.48,0:14:36.69,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,輕鬆舉起
Comment: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:38.38,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,扔得遠遠的
Comment: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:41.80,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣這樣然後再這樣...
Comment: 0,0:14:37.63,0:14:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒有人乘坐 也沒有電池
Comment: 0,0:14:39.99,0:14:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和中午的警備機器人一樣
Comment: 0,0:14:41.96,0:14:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,完全沒有頭緒啊
Comment: 0,0:14:43.98,0:14:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是真的!
Comment: 0,0:14:45.34,0:14:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果能讓我調查這附近的監視攝影機
Comment: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就可以知道了
Comment: 0,0:14:49.03,0:14:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,並不是懷疑妳們
Comment: 0,0:14:52.21,0:14:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 不管哪台監視攝影器的影像...
Comment: 0,0:14:54.75,0:14:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都沒有紀錄到任何異常
Comment: 0,0:14:57.47,0:14:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,監視攝影機...
Comment: 0,0:14:58.98,0:14:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這麼說
Comment: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,叫救護車之前手機也沒有訊號
Comment: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總之這裡就交給我們吧
Comment: 0,0:15:05.24,0:15:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是...
Comment: 0,0:15:06.25,0:15:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們的朋友被送到醫院了對吧
Comment: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,快點去吧
Comment: 0,0:15:10.73,0:15:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我知道了
Comment: 0,0:15:12.04,0:15:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春
Comment: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好的
Comment: 0,0:15:14.20,0:15:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼先走了
Comment: 0,0:15:17.95,0:15:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:15:18.93,0:15:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,到底為什麼會這樣
Comment: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是什麼?
Comment: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我知道了
Comment: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,掰掰
Comment: 0,0:15:38.87,0:15:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子她們馬上就會過來
Comment: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,似乎也沒有受傷
Comment: 0,0:15:44.29,0:15:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,應該不會有事吧
Comment: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是的
Comment: 0,0:15:54.79,0:15:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,讓大家擔心
Comment: 0,0:15:57.27,0:15:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等她清醒後我來好好唸唸她
Comment: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理!
Comment: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,醫生 那個...
Comment: 0,0:16:06.78,0:16:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無法退燒
Comment: 0,0:16:08.67,0:16:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,意識依然無法恢復
Comment: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無法了解病情惡化的原因
Comment: 0,0:16:14.07,0:16:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,老實說我們實在束手無策了
Comment: 0,0:16:15.96,0:16:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總之
Comment: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,在這裡我們無法治療她
Comment: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,要盡快送到大醫院去
Comment: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理...
Comment: 0,0:16:26.58,0:16:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這是妳的對吧
Comment: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好好地拿著
Comment: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們的研究
Comment: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對電磁砲非常適用
Comment: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:44.00,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(870,980)}Railgun
Comment: 0,0:16:44.96,0:16:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,實驗以那種形式被迫中斷
Comment: 0,0:16:47.50,0:16:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是可惜
Comment: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,被自己飼養的狗反咬一口 就是指這種情況吧
Comment: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不過有了今天的資料
Comment: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,程式的精準度更高了
Comment: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是多虧了排名第三的人啊
Comment: 0,0:16:59.82,0:17:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這也證明了另外一點
Comment: 0,0:17:03.14,0:17:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只能依靠能力的傢伙們是如此的無能啊
Comment: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這正是
Comment: 0,0:17:08.55,0:17:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,學園都市的矛盾所在啊
Comment: 0,0:17:10.90,0:17:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,接下來
Comment: 0,0:17:11.79,0:17:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,現在表決吧
Comment: 0,0:17:14.62,0:17:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,關於菲布理的處置
Comment: 0,0:17:23.24,0:17:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,好像...
Comment: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,進去很久了呢
Comment: 0,0:17:27.04,0:17:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個到底是什麼
Comment: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果那東西沒有出現的話
Comment: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理就不會變成這樣...
Comment: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然不知道是何方神聖
Comment: 0,0:17:38.06,0:17:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那是
Comment: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,針對我來的
Comment: 0,0:17:42.14,0:17:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,都是因為我...
Comment: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又...
Comment: 0,0:17:46.13,0:17:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,把別人..
Comment: 0,0:17:46.84,0:17:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,捲入是非...
Comment: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,姐姐大人
Comment: 0,0:17:53.74,0:17:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,黑子
Comment: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,初春
Comment: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理怎麼樣了?
Comment: 0,0:17:57.54,0:17:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這個
Comment: 0,0:17:58.36,0:17:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,還...
Comment: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊...
Comment: 0,0:18:00.59,0:18:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們那邊呢?
Comment: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,警備員正在逐步調查中
Comment: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:05.30,Default-furigana,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\pos(747,980)}Anti-skill
Comment: 0,0:18:05.91,0:18:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,目前仍毫無頭緒...
Comment: 0,0:18:09.43,0:18:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,話說
Comment: 0,0:18:10.56,0:18:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,為什麼妳跟來了?
Comment: 0,0:18:13.26,0:18:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳問我為什麼
Comment: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,當然是因為擔心菲布理啊
Comment: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,又被妳拯救了呢
Comment: 0,0:18:19.84,0:18:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝妳 婚后
Comment: 0,0:18:21.48,0:18:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說到這個 妳剛剛有打電話給我
Comment: 0,0:18:24.14,0:18:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,對啊
Comment: 0,0:18:25.51,0:18:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我想要通知大家
Comment: 0,0:18:28.23,0:18:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理有危險
Comment: 0,0:18:31.59,0:18:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛才
Comment: 0,0:18:32.46,0:18:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我在學究會的會場附近 遇到一個曾經見過的男人
Comment: 0,0:18:36.26,0:18:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,然後...
Comment: 0,0:18:38.28,0:18:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那是...
Comment: 0,0:18:40.00,0:18:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳要做什麼?
Comment: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,只是去和那個人稍微聊一聊
Comment: 0,0:18:45.10,0:18:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,他似乎誤解了婚后的為人
Comment: 0,0:18:48.74,0:18:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,就是啊
Comment: 0,0:18:49.90,0:18:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,和他說明他一定能理解的
Comment: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸...等...
Comment: 0,0:18:53.67,0:18:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,目標移動中
Comment: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒錯
Comment: 0,0:18:57.03,0:18:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,雖然菲布理的回收失敗了
Comment: 0,0:18:59.24,0:19:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但沒想到竟然有這樣的額外收穫
Comment: 0,0:19:04.34,0:19:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,替我送過來
Comment: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,拜託了
Comment: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,似乎能得到非常有趣的結果
Comment: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理被盯上了?
Comment: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是
Comment: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,完全聯絡不到大家
Comment: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒辦法 只好分頭去找妳們 偶然就遇到了
Comment: 0,0:19:19.40,0:19:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,等我一下
Comment: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,喂
Comment: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 是灣內和泡浮
Comment: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是對不起
Comment: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我完全忘記要聯絡妳們了
Comment: 0,0:19:30.95,0:19:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是的
Comment: 0,0:19:31.59,0:19:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我找到御坂她們了
Comment: 0,0:19:33.35,0:19:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,也找到菲布理了
Comment: 0,0:19:34.44,0:19:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是...
Comment: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,欸? 我?
Comment: 0,0:19:36.28,0:19:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我沒事的啦
Comment: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳讓她們擔心了
Comment: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們這邊沒事的
Comment: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這怎麼可以!
Comment: 0,0:19:45.48,0:19:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 不好意思
Comment: 0,0:19:46.85,0:19:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,因為我的事
Comment: 0,0:19:48.23,0:19:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們一直替我找 一定很累了吧
Comment: 0,0:19:51.71,0:19:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 不用
Comment: 0,0:19:52.79,0:19:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那麼應該是我去妳們那邊
Comment: 0,0:19:55.50,0:19:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,別這樣說...
Comment: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的啦 請不要擔心
Comment: 0,0:20:01.38,0:20:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個
Comment: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,非常抱歉
Comment: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我先告辭了
Comment: 0,0:20:06.37,0:20:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,但是 如果有什麼事情
Comment: 0,0:20:07.96,0:20:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,請告訴我喔
Comment: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我們也是菲布理的朋友
Comment: 0,0:20:14.06,0:20:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,謝謝
Comment: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,剛剛提到的事情
Comment: 0,0:20:18.31,0:20:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是怎麼一回事啊
Comment: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,回收菲布理...
Comment: 0,0:20:21.59,0:20:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,到底是什麼...
Comment: 0,0:20:22.95,0:20:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,說什麼回收...
Comment: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理又不是東西
Comment: 0,0:20:44.11,0:20:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳們幾個
Comment: 0,0:20:51.87,0:20:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理!
Comment: 0,0:20:53.56,0:20:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這...
Comment: 0,0:20:55.49,0:20:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,啊 美琴
Comment: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳沒事了嗎?
Comment: 0,0:20:57.85,0:20:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:20:59.15,0:21:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,沒問題
Comment: 0,0:21:00.23,0:21:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,菲布理
Comment: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,妳突然昏倒
Comment: 0,0:21:02.71,0:21:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,大家都很擔心喔
Comment: 0,0:21:05.59,0:21:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,呱太沒事嗎?
Comment: 0,0:21:09.29,0:21:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,總之看起來很有精神
Comment: 0,0:21:15.42,0:21:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可以借一步說話嗎?
Comment: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,真的沒有會痛的地方嗎?
Comment: 0,0:21:20.67,0:21:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不痛!
Comment: 0,0:21:22.15,0:21:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,這樣啊這樣啊
Comment: 0,0:21:22.15,0:21:23.72,Upside,,0,0,0,karaoke,真是太好了
Comment: 0,0:21:23.36,0:21:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那個...
Comment: 0,0:21:24.74,0:21:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,非常感謝
Comment: 0,0:21:26.52,0:21:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不會
Comment: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我什麼都沒做
Comment: 0,0:21:29.94,0:21:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,可是...
Comment: 0,0:21:31.39,0:21:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,我沒辦法治療那孩子
Comment: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,無法治療指的是...
Comment: 0,0:21:35.45,0:21:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是怎麼一回事?
Comment: 0,0:21:37.12,0:21:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,莫非...
Comment: 0,0:21:37.83,0:21:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是重病還是...
Comment: 0,0:21:39.44,0:21:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是
Comment: 0,0:21:40.74,0:21:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,如果是人類的病的話就可以治療
Comment: 0,0:21:46.86,0:21:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,那孩子
Comment: 0,0:21:48.10,0:21:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,不是人類
Comment: 0,0:21:50.80,0:21:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是100%科學製造的...
Comment: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,人造物
Comment: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:06.67,Default,ED,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:29.97,0:23:31.26,Default,next,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:23:30.84,0:23:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,由我來做預告什麼的
Comment: 0,0:23:32.55,0:23:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,是身為朋友理所當然該做的事情
Comment: 0,0:23:35.06,0:23:36.59,Default,s,0,0,0,karaoke,我好擔心菲布理啊
Comment: 0,0:23:36.73,0:23:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,下一回
Comment: 0,0:23:37.23,0:23:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,婚后航空的世界之旅!
Comment: 0,0:23:38.49,0:23:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,karaoke,才不是咧!
Comment: 0,0:23:39.98,0:23:47.98,Default,thanks,0,0,0,,
